# The Legend of Zelda: The Minish Cap (USA): the title screen to the file select (gate G7, saves: the EEPROM chip).
# Start at frame 1,100 and 1,400 (the title appears after the logos), then no key: with the save written by minish_cap_new_file_home.keys the file select shows the file made by the first process, with no save an empty file select.
# The frame limit is 2,200.
# frame,keyinput_active_low (the value holds until the next line)
0,0x03ff
1100,0x03f7
1104,0x03ff
1400,0x03f7
1404,0x03ff
